{"name":"12-3-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"2019summer_7","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"m_avg_casual","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I found the next memory fragment. Shall we proceed with the upload?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If we don't, we cannot proceed."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is this okay, M4? Your memories..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's fine, Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We must hurry up and complete our work here. The Military will attack any minute."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then RO, if you would."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_wind_grass","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"flashback","raw":"回忆"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4A1 and ST AR-15 walked on for 15 minutes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Sneak","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's getting dark and t