orch was littered with children's toys, and the joyful laughter of the past still lingered in the air. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"ST AR-15 carefully stepped around the innocent drawings strewn across the porch and picked up a teddy bear lying forlornly on the floor. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There were several bald patches on the soft toy. It was plain that it had been well loved and frequently hugged."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Noticing the splatters of blood on the teddy bear, ST AR-15 frowned."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"flashback","raw":"回忆"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop. There's movement in the house."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Enemies?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're in luck. It's a military relay station. This house is unexpectedly popular."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let me have a look."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"See that? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Internal scans of the building are available from ten meters away. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The comms equipment is intact and functional. The station is only manned by non-combat personnel. We can use the equipment once we wipe them out."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You intend to fire at unarmed humans?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Armed or not, they're still our enemies. The threat they pose is in their technical expertise."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Have you suddenly developed some form of sympathy for them? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Have you forgotten how their soldiers slaughtered your Doll friends? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Or do you perhaps think that the act of killing Dolls doesn't constitute murder?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I did not say that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's just...from the way you talk and act, I can tell...you aren't M4A1."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humph..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Danger","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've noticed something odd for a while now. M4A1 always seemed to be talking to herself..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She is definitely not acting under her own will! Who the hell are you?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Does that matter? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The most important thing right now is for us to survive. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"More specifically, for M4A1 to survive. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't believe there's a conflict of interests here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Since you agree, then let's not waste any more time on such meaningless discussion."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humph... So how are you planning to attack?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hmm... I have some good news which will spare you from a guilty conscience."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The humans in there are all infected."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All that's left are communications personnel who have lost their mind. Just send them on their way and put an end to their suffering."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"冰湖","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"flashback","raw":"回忆"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bangbangbang... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The soldiers that had partially mutated into ELIDs collapsed onto the floor. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"ST AR-15 lowered her weapon upon completing the extermination."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[