hines or living lifeforms is beside the point. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Going by your logic, a kitchen knife shouldn't be optimized for cutting up vegetables. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No matter how you try to justify it, the truth is that humans are leaving all the dirty work to Dolls."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's nothing to feel ashamed of. After all, \"whatever is reasonable is true, and whatever is true is reasonable.\" That's the rule we all play by. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The way I see it, a Tactical Doll that can't kill would be more useful working as a barista in a café. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Showing mercy to your enemies is a sign of incompetence in humans and T-Dolls alike."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't have to worry at all! The Commander has never shown mercy to our enemies!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"According to Griffin records, you do seem to have a consistent habit of sparing no one. That, I find very reassuring."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Somehow that doesn't feel like a compliment at all..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ahem... Can we save the chit-chat for later? I'm having some problem with the transfer. A little help, please?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A memory fragment has merely got stuck in the middle of reloading. That can easily be resolved on Level II."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't just let me do all the heavy-lifting! Aren't you supposed to be going through the memories with me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fine, I'll help. Hurry up and clear away the irrelevant content."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"White","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
